cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the exact PyPSA-col release/commit and its configuration and data manifest.
  A release DOI has not been assigned. Also cite PyPSA, Linopy, Atlite, HiGHS,
  ColombiaCongestionV2, Grid2Poster, XM and any climate/geographic datasets used.
title: 'PyPSA-col: auditable Colombian power-system research workflows'
version: 0.1.0
date-released: '2026-10-12'
type: software
authors:
  - name: 'PyPSA-col contributors'
abstract: >-
  A reproducible research scaffold using a pinned ColombiaCongestionV2 source,
  XM data ingestion, Atlite ERA5 adapters, PyPSA/Linopy dispatch and multi-period
  expansion, hydro drought constraints, and Grid2Poster maps. Demonstration
  outputs are not a validated national Colombian planning model.
keywords:
  - PyPSA
  - Colombia
  - power systems
  - capacity expansion
  - hydroelectricity
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
